      "topic_ids": ["statistical_ml__linear_regression_least_squares"],
      "support_tags": ["least_squares", "mean_squared_error", "closed_form"],
      "keywords": ["线性回归", "最小二乘", "均方误差", "闭式解"],
      "content": "线性回归用线性函数 f(x)=wx+b 拟合连续值目标。最小二乘法（least square）最小化均方误差（mean squared error）Σ(yi−f(xi))²。一元回归有闭式解：b=ȳ−w·x̄，w=Σ(xi−x̄)(yi−ȳ)/Σ(xi−x̄)²。",
      "language": "bilingual",
      "source_role": "course_core",
      "content_type": "algorithm",
